  "body": "Step into an unparalleled world of elegance and comfort with this masterpiece in the heart of Ara Hills. Boasting stunning street appeal, this luxurious sunny residence is a testament to superior craftsmanship and sophisticated design with multiple living arrangements.\r\n\r\nBoasting:\r\n*\tGrand Entrance & Spacious Living\r\n*\tExpansive living area featuring exquisite barn doors that lead to an elegant and inviting lounge, perfect for both entertaining and relaxation\r\n*\tFive Spacious Bedrooms including the North facing master ensuite which is a true sanctuary with two walk-in wardrobes and a private balcony, offering a serene escape\r\n*\tOffice space / granny potential: 2-bedroom with separate entry and more . . .\r\n*\tLarge garage with storage plus separate laundry\r\n*\tIndulge in the luxury of three upmarket bathrooms with underfloor heating and LED mirrors featuring Italian tiles, ensuring a touch of European elegance plus guest toilet\r\n*\tThe heart of the home is an elegant and grand kitchen, complete with high-end Bosch appliances, including two ovens and a built-in microwave-oven\r\n*\tThe kitchen island and large walk-in pantry with an elegant scullery kitchen are perfect for the culinary enthusiast plus mobile phone charging stations\r\n*\tEvery detail, from the Villeroy & Boch tapware to the engineered hardwood flooring, speaks of refinement and quality\r\n*\tThis home is adorned with LED feature lights that enhance the ambiance from the kitchen to the bathrooms and out onto the expansive Vitex decking\r\n*\tA large double-sided fireplace, surrounded by Italian tiles, creates a warm and inviting atmosphere\r\n*\tExpansive Vitex decks, ideal for alfresco dining and entertaining with fully landscaped exquisite garden\r\n\r\nExperience the epitome of luxury living in Ara Hills. Step into a high quality home where elegance meets comfort.\r\n\r\nContact Shaun today at 021 871 252 to schedule your private viewing.",
